@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SimSun
skinparam defaultFontSize 20
skinparam ArrowColor black
skinparam ClassBackgroundColor white
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor white
skinparam NoteBorderColor black
skinparam PackageBackgroundColor white
skinparam PackageBorderColor black
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam minClassWidth 210
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam nodesep 65
skinparam ranksep 75
hide circle
hide empty members
package "原单申请与负责人审核" as R {
' @reference patient_funds
class "患者资金" as funds_r <<entity>>
' @reference bill
class "应收账目" as bill_r <<entity>>
' @reference patient_payment
class "患者付款" as payment_r <<entity>>
class "费用申请" as fee_request <<entity>> {
 原因、证据、提交版本及时间
 拟调整额、拟退上限
 申请状态、批准调整及退款上限
 审核人、时间及意见
 --
 +核对原单归属及申请额度()
 +提交或补正重提()
 +记录批准退回或拒绝(审核依据)
 +撤回未审核申请()
 +计算剩余可办退款额度()
}
funds_r "1" -- "0..*" fee_request
bill_r "0..1" -- "0..*" fee_request
payment_r "0..1" -- "0..*" fee_request
funds_r -[hidden]right- bill_r
bill_r -[hidden]right- payment_r
note bottom of fee_request
原账或原付款至少一项；都属于同一患者。
未批准不生效调整或退款；退回补正保留原提交。
批准额与真实退款分开，撤回仅限未审核申请。
end note
}
package "批准调整与原费用明细" as A {
' @reference fee_request
class "费用申请" as request_a <<entity>>
' @reference bill
class "应收账目" as bill_a <<entity>>
' @reference bill_item
class "应收项目" as item_a <<entity>>
class "费用调整" as fee_adjustment <<entity>> {
 调整依据、生效时间
 批准负责人
 --
 +核对申请已批准且未生效()
 +核对明细合计与批准额()
 +确认调整及必要用途释放()
}
class "调整项目" as fee_adjustment_item <<entity>> {
 带符号调整额、原项说明
 --
 +核对同账原项目()
 +核对调整后应收非负()
}
request_a "1" -- "0..1" fee_adjustment
bill_a "1" -- "0..*" fee_adjustment
fee_adjustment "1" *-- "1..*" fee_adjustment_item
item_a "1" -- "0..*" fee_adjustment_item
request_a -[hidden]right- bill_a
note bottom of fee_adjustment_item
批准调整与必要原用途释放共同生效。
已医保结算费用先核实撤销及最终重新分摊；
未知不确定最终退补差额，需补收转UC-13。
仅退未用预款不形成费用调整。
end note
}
package "实际退款、未知核实及失败重办" as T {
' @reference fee_request
class "费用申请" as request_t <<entity>>
' @reference patient_payment
class "患者付款" as payment_t <<entity>>
' @reference patient_funds
class "患者资金" as funds_t <<entity>>
' @reference patient_refund
class "退款办理" as previous_refund_t <<entity>>
class "退款办理" as patient_refund <<entity>> {
 唯一退款号、原渠道、接收方核实
 拟退额、实际额、办理时间
 待办理／待核实／已确认退款／已失败
 核实人、时间、凭据及失败依据
 --
 +核对批准额度及原款可用额()
 +建立办理并占用额度()
 +保留未知结果与占用()
 +确认实际退款(真实金额与凭据)
 +确认失败并释放占用(依据)
 +关联失败原单重办()
}
request_t "1" -- "0..*" patient_refund
payment_t "1" -- "0..*" patient_refund
funds_t "1" -- "0..*" patient_refund
previous_refund_t "原失败单\n0..1" -- "0..*" patient_refund
request_t -[hidden]right- payment_t
payment_t -[hidden]right- funds_t
note bottom of patient_refund
拟退不超批准剩余额及原款可用额。
待办／未知占用拟退额；失败释放，成功扣实际额。
0＜实际额≤拟退额，部分成功重核剩余额。
查原笔后补记，不能因未知重发；医保款不退作现金。
end note
}
@enduml
